webwg (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package with debhelper and pybuild from pyproject.toml in place of
    stdeb, for Debian 13 and later and Ubuntu 25.04 and later.
  * Run the service as the webwg system user with only CAP_NET_ADMIN.
  * Use Bootstrap Icons in place of Font Awesome Pro, so the build needs no
    private npm registry and the package holds no commercial fonts.

 -- Matthew Shaw <mshaw.cx@gmail.com>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:43:32 -0400
